          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Abusalomu abaza Hushayi, at’ Urwo ni rwo rukundo ukunze wa mukunzi wawe? Mbega k’utajanye na we? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hushayi yishura Abusalomu, at’ Ekaye; arik’ ūtoranijwe n’ Uhoraho n’iri hanga bo n’ingabo zose z’Abisirayeli, nzoba uwiwe, ni we nzogendanira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
